OL,3,GNEWSAArrests made after visit from
OL,4,Aformer US President Biden
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two arrests have been made
OL,7,Ffollowing a surprise visit from former
OL,8,FUS President Joe Biden to Trinity
OL,9,FCollege in Dublin on Tuesday.
OL,11,FBiden was accompanied by former first
OL,12,Flady Jill Biden as they attended a
OL,13,Fceremony where their son Hunter was
OL,14,Fawarded the Gold Medal for Outstanding
OL,15,FContribution for Public Discourse.
OL,17,FDuring the trio's visit to the College
OL,18,FHistorical Society groups of
OL,19,Fpro-Palestinian protesters gathered,
OL,20,Fsome of whom were detained by gardai
OL,21,F(Irish police).
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
